\f5\b \cf4 \cb3 Totals (FR006).
\f4\b0  Once you have an 
\f7\fs24 \cf8 \cb9 \strokec8 IEnumerable<Transaction>
\f4\fs32 \cf4 \cb3 \strokec4 , the totals are one line each, for example 
